Package: rk3399-fanctl
Version: 0.1.0-dev
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: device-tree-compiler, coreutils
Maintainer: Your Name <you@example.com>
Description: Fan control utility for RK3399 boards (NanoPC-T4 and others)
 rk3399-fanctl manages PWM fan cooling-levels in the Device Tree of
 RK3399-based single board computers. It provides safe backup/restore
 of the DTB, validation of input values, and (planned) automatic fan
 calibration and live monitoring.
